msgstr "Switched-off features no longer register menus, pages, shortcodes, REST routes or background tasks. Tables and settings are kept; switching a feature on again continues where it left off."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:108
msgid "Im Menü ausblenden"
msgstr "Hide in menu"

