msgstr "Requests contain a forwarding header (e.g. X-Forwarded-For or CF-Connecting-IP), but no trusted proxies are entered under “Settings → Advanced”. If the site runs behind a CDN or proxy, many buyers share a few addresses; the checkout limit per address has therefore been raised temporarily. Please enter the proxy addresses and the header containing the client address."

